{"parse":{"title":"天赋/刚毅之枪","pageid":1228,"revid":6085,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E5%88%9A%E6%AF%85%E4%B9%8B%E6%9E%AA&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E5%88%9A%E6%AF%85%E4%B9%8B%E6%9E%AA&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B/%E5%88%9A%E6%AF%85%E4%B9%8B%E6%9E%AA&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>刚毅之枪</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.88.9A.E6.AF.85.E4.B9.8B.E6.9E.AA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"刚毅之枪\"><b>刚毅之枪</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"天赋 冲阵之枪.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/60/85oxa9tsqme4uf0be6mm9nmv0kh2apl.png/80px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B_%E5%86%B2%E9%98%B5%E4%B9%8B%E6%9E%AA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/60/85oxa9tsqme4uf0be6mm9nmv0kh2apl.png/120px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B_%E5%86%B2%E9%98%B5%E4%B9%8B%E6%9E%AA.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/60/85oxa9tsqme4uf0be6mm9nmv0kh2apl.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />刚毅之枪\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>被[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">正面</span>]近战攻击时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"red\">5%</font>，被攻击后，反伤对方造成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，威力为自身物攻值的<font color=\"red\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9B%87%E4%BD%A3%E9%95%BF%E6%9E%AA%E5%85%B5\" title=\"角色图鉴库/雇佣长枪兵\"><img alt=\"头像 雇佣长枪兵.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b5/qppucmz25whxt6o3296fjllosrmgza8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">雇佣长枪兵</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>被[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">正面</span>]近战攻击时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"red\">7%</font>，被攻击后，反伤对方造成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，威力为自身物攻值的<font color=\"red\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/5d/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>被[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">正面</span>]近战攻击时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"red\">9%</font>，被攻击后，反伤对方造成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，威力为自身物攻值的<font color=\"red\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋四星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>被[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">正面</span>]近战攻击时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"red\">12%</font>，被攻击后，反伤对方造成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，威力为自身物攻值的<font color=\"red\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"天赋五星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bf/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/56px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bf/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/84px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/bf/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/112px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>被[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">正面</span>]近战攻击时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"red\">15%</font>，被攻击后，反伤对方造成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，威力为自身物攻值的<font color=\"red\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163541\nCache expiry: 86400\n